WEBVTT

00:06.172 --> 00:08.425
<i>The True Demon King has died.</i>

00:10.135 --> 00:13.847
<i>The enemy of the world
that filled the horizon with fear,</i>

00:13.847 --> 00:15.849
<i>was defeated by somebody.</i>

00:16.766 --> 00:19.102
<i>To this very day,</i>

00:19.102 --> 00:22.230
<i>that lone Hero remains unknown,
both in name and existence.</i>

00:23.356 --> 00:26.151
<i>Now the age of fear has come to an end,</i>

00:26.860 --> 00:30.196
<i>that person has to be chosen.</i>

00:45.211 --> 00:49.090
ISHURA

02:03.039 --> 02:04.249
Episode 4

02:04.249 --> 02:06.918
Nihilo the Vortical Stampede
and Kia the World Word

02:06.918 --> 02:10.964
Aureatia
Central Detention Center

02:17.137 --> 02:20.431
Lord Hidow, we've received a report
from headquarters in Mage City.

02:20.431 --> 02:25.228
Jeez. Do New Principality issues
fall under my jurisdiction already?

02:25.228 --> 02:26.312
Yes, sir.

02:26.312 --> 02:29.649
The Third Minister
sent notification this morning.

02:30.233 --> 02:31.359
Jelki, huh?

02:31.734 --> 02:34.904
So he's still working
at breakneck speed then.

02:34.904 --> 02:36.406
All right, what was the report?

02:36.406 --> 02:40.493
Regular communication from 10 members
of our secret service has stopped.

02:41.077 --> 02:43.621
In a matter of one day...

02:43.621 --> 02:45.790
Their base must have been surrounded.

02:45.790 --> 02:48.501
What about survivors? Did nobody escape?

02:48.501 --> 02:50.545
No, sir, not a single person.

02:51.171 --> 02:53.506
All were elite agents
commanded by the Seventeenth Minister.

02:53.882 --> 02:54.966
Hmm...

02:57.135 --> 02:59.971
How many will you need?

03:00.471 --> 03:02.432
For this tactical squad,

03:02.932 --> 03:04.934
I'd want the 64 members of Squad 16.

03:05.310 --> 03:06.895
I'd probably need a sniper team too.

03:06.895 --> 03:08.938
Does Miss Elea know about this?

03:08.938 --> 03:10.023
Miss Elea?

03:10.023 --> 03:12.066
The Seventeenth Minister.

03:12.066 --> 03:13.985
Elea the Red Tag.

03:13.985 --> 03:16.446
She leads the tactical squads.

03:16.446 --> 03:19.532
You should probably report to her first,
not me.

03:19.991 --> 03:23.536
Although I heard she's currently
undercover on a different operation.

03:23.536 --> 03:24.621
Yes, sir.

03:24.996 --> 03:28.833
She appears to be in a remote region
where radzio communication isn't possible.

03:28.833 --> 03:32.128
So I thought I'd report to you first,
as you're the person in charge.

03:32.128 --> 03:33.671
The person in charge?

03:33.671 --> 03:34.756
Come on.

03:34.756 --> 03:37.258
I haven't been officially appointed yet.

03:37.258 --> 03:38.676
That may be true, but...

03:42.305 --> 03:46.100
Man, everyone around here
just does as they please.

03:46.100 --> 03:48.811
Shall we send in new undercover agents?

03:48.811 --> 03:51.981
We'd only be sending them to their deaths.

03:51.981 --> 03:53.858
We need to try something else.

03:54.984 --> 03:57.654
<i>To the east of Mage City Headquarters,</i>

03:57.654 --> 04:00.406
<i>there's sunken ground
that's been carved out by a stream.</i>

04:00.865 --> 04:03.451
<i>Have your men set up camp there.</i>

04:04.035 --> 04:05.787
I know of that sunken ground,

04:05.787 --> 04:08.456
but it's extremely far out
from headquarters.

04:08.456 --> 04:11.292
It's not a particularly useful
position for defense.

04:11.292 --> 04:13.253
We'll use it to attack.

04:13.253 --> 04:16.464
Those pesky wyverns won't spot us there.

04:16.464 --> 04:20.051
I'll send over
a few fortification experts tomorrow.

04:20.260 --> 04:21.344
Understood.

04:21.594 --> 04:22.595
Incidentally,

04:23.263 --> 04:25.890
about the release
of the Vortical Stampede...

04:25.890 --> 04:27.308
Lord Hidow,

04:27.308 --> 04:29.018
will you be in control of this?

04:29.018 --> 04:31.604
Sure, move out of the way.

04:41.239 --> 04:42.991
I know you're awake, Nihilo.

04:49.455 --> 04:50.873
Don't worry,

04:50.873 --> 04:52.375
I'm awake now.

04:52.375 --> 04:55.211
Apparently, 10 secret service members
based in the New Principality

04:55.211 --> 04:57.547
were all killed in a single day.

04:57.547 --> 04:58.923
Interesting...

04:58.923 --> 05:00.883
How many would you need?

05:01.968 --> 05:03.052
One.

05:03.594 --> 05:06.681
<i>Nihilo the Vortical Stampede.</i>

05:06.973 --> 05:11.519
<i>This girl single-handedly annihilated
a whole regional army in Aureatia.</i>

05:22.488 --> 05:23.823
Or should I say,

05:24.615 --> 05:26.409
one being and one body.

05:26.409 --> 05:28.911
<i>According to all current records,</i>

05:28.911 --> 05:31.789
<i>she's the most horrific bioweapon
there is.</i>

05:31.789 --> 05:34.792
Eta Sylvan Province

05:47.597 --> 05:50.308
Minia
Seventeenth Minister: Elea the Red Tag

05:52.143 --> 05:53.895
<i>My great-grandmother used to say</i>

05:54.937 --> 05:58.691
<i>that beauty is a talent given to us
by an angel when we're born.</i>

05:59.942 --> 06:00.943
<i>But...</i>

06:02.320 --> 06:03.905
<i>I don't think that's true.</i>

06:07.075 --> 06:10.203
<i>Beauty appears with talent and hard work.</i>

06:11.079 --> 06:14.582
<i>It requires
continuous and meticulous maintenance.</i>

06:20.296 --> 06:21.339
Yawika?

06:21.839 --> 06:22.840
Oh.

06:22.840 --> 06:23.925
Ms. Elea!

06:23.925 --> 06:25.218
But why?

06:25.218 --> 06:27.470
I thought you'd gone back to Aureatia.

06:31.766 --> 06:33.976
Your body is so beautiful!

06:33.976 --> 06:35.853
Y-You think so?

06:36.354 --> 06:37.480
Thank you.

06:42.735 --> 06:44.946
Lessons are over now,

06:44.946 --> 06:47.281
but I'll be in this village
until tomorrow.

06:47.281 --> 06:49.742
I thought I'd take a bath before I go.

06:49.742 --> 06:50.827
Right!

06:51.244 --> 06:52.662
Will Kia be here until tomorrow too?

06:52.662 --> 06:53.746
Of course.

06:53.746 --> 06:56.999
She'll come and say bye to everyone
when we leave.

06:56.999 --> 06:58.876
Ms. Elea,

06:58.876 --> 06:59.961
teach me something.

06:59.961 --> 07:01.379
A private lesson for me!

07:01.379 --> 07:03.214
I guess I have no choice.

07:03.881 --> 07:05.967
Okay, but Words Arts systems only.

07:05.967 --> 07:07.301
I don't want you getting dizzy.

07:07.301 --> 07:08.386
Yay!

07:10.888 --> 07:14.350
In Word Arts,
there are four main systems.

07:14.892 --> 07:17.437
Though elves don't really differentiate
between them.

07:17.437 --> 07:18.855
But in the Central...

07:19.313 --> 07:21.941
In minian education, that's not the case.

07:21.941 --> 07:23.109
I know!

07:23.109 --> 07:25.111
There's Thermal Arts, Craft Arts,

07:25.111 --> 07:26.362
and...

07:26.779 --> 07:27.822
What else was there?

07:27.822 --> 07:29.490
Oh, well done!

07:29.490 --> 07:31.325
You already knew two of them.

07:31.325 --> 07:33.327
Did you study this by yourself?

07:33.327 --> 07:36.247
Nope! Muya from next door told me.

07:36.873 --> 07:39.208
I did know three but I forgot.

07:39.208 --> 07:40.960
Let's see...

07:41.961 --> 07:43.671
Thermal Arts, Craft Arts,

07:43.671 --> 07:45.715
Force Arts, and Life Arts.

07:45.715 --> 07:47.133
These are the four systems.

07:47.133 --> 07:48.384
Huh?

07:48.384 --> 07:49.594
Now I remember!

07:51.220 --> 07:52.805
What a good student you are.

07:54.807 --> 07:57.101
You understand Thermal Arts,
don't you?

07:57.685 --> 08:01.814
It's the thing your mother
uses all the time in the kitchen.

08:01.814 --> 08:03.065
I can use it too!

08:03.065 --> 08:04.150
Oh!

08:04.734 --> 08:09.030
Then next time I come,
I'll have you cook something for me.

08:09.030 --> 08:11.157
Yay! Just leave it to me.

08:11.991 --> 08:13.618
Now, as for Force Arts...

08:13.618 --> 08:15.495
From Elea to the waters of Eta.

08:15.495 --> 08:16.829
Wingless bug,

08:16.829 --> 08:19.248
swollen leaf, tender spine. Fly!

08:20.666 --> 08:22.460
Oh, sorry about that!

08:22.460 --> 08:24.670
I'm not very good at Force Arts.

08:24.670 --> 08:26.881
Don't worry, I'm fine!

08:27.465 --> 08:28.925
But it worked, didn't it?

08:28.925 --> 08:31.177
Moving things, sending them flying.

08:31.761 --> 08:33.596
That's what Force Arts is all about.

08:33.930 --> 08:34.931
For example,

08:34.931 --> 08:38.309
have you ever seen an arrow fired
from a bow change direction mid-flight?

08:38.309 --> 08:39.477
I have!

08:39.477 --> 08:40.895
I think...

08:40.895 --> 08:43.564
Once you master Force Arts,

08:43.564 --> 08:46.234
you can even fly in the sky,

08:46.234 --> 08:48.194
even if only for a brief moment.

08:48.194 --> 08:49.612
That's amazing!

08:49.612 --> 08:51.864
Then what about Craft Arts?

08:52.448 --> 08:54.367
Okay, please watch.

08:55.159 --> 08:56.661
From Elea to the waters of Eta.

08:56.661 --> 08:58.246
Twelve bones, ocean's floor,

08:58.246 --> 09:00.039
ashes of the end. Halt.

09:06.963 --> 09:08.047
Wow!

09:08.881 --> 09:09.882
Ice?

09:10.508 --> 09:13.427
But is it really?

09:17.181 --> 09:20.393
It's warm. So it's not ice. But how?

09:20.393 --> 09:23.104
Craft Arts are used
to change the shape of things.

09:23.604 --> 09:26.107
Just like how we give a tree a new shape
in the form of furniture,

09:26.107 --> 09:29.485
we can give shape to hot water like this.

09:29.485 --> 09:30.653
That's amazing!

09:38.494 --> 09:39.954
Just one left.

09:39.954 --> 09:41.163
Life Arts.

09:41.163 --> 09:43.916
To put it simply,
this is what doctors use.

09:44.542 --> 09:47.169
There are people who mend your wounds
or heal your colds, right?

09:47.169 --> 09:49.171
Granny Micch does it for me.

09:49.797 --> 09:51.424
But recently,

09:51.424 --> 09:52.800
I don't get hurt at all.

09:52.800 --> 09:53.884
I see.

09:54.385 --> 09:58.889
But no matter how amazing Granny Micch is,
she wouldn't be able to heal my wounds.

09:58.889 --> 10:00.516
The wounds of an outsider.

10:00.516 --> 10:02.435
Do you know why that is?

10:02.435 --> 10:03.728
Um...

10:04.770 --> 10:08.024
If you haven't spent a long time
together with a person,

10:08.024 --> 10:10.735
you won't understand
the words to convey with Word Arts.

10:11.277 --> 10:12.987
The same goes for the wind, water,

10:12.987 --> 10:14.947
trees and iron.

10:14.947 --> 10:17.116
Wouldn't it work between us?

10:17.116 --> 10:18.200
No.

10:18.200 --> 10:22.121
However, water is obedient,
different from living things.

10:22.121 --> 10:24.707
It's been just under six months
since I came here,

10:24.707 --> 10:27.209
but even I can use Word Arts with it.

10:27.209 --> 10:30.463
Let me teach you something else
that Life Arts can be used for.

10:31.047 --> 10:32.673
From Elea to the waters of Eta.

10:32.673 --> 10:34.592
Hollow of the folding tree.

10:34.592 --> 10:36.636
Mound of dark sinews,
reflecting shell. Dissolve.

10:38.554 --> 10:39.930
Give it a lick.

10:41.849 --> 10:43.559
It's sweet!

10:43.559 --> 10:45.519
Unlike Craft Arts,

10:45.519 --> 10:47.938
which change the shape of things,

10:47.938 --> 10:50.566
Life Arts change the property of things.

10:50.566 --> 10:53.486
You can even change water to wine.

10:53.486 --> 10:54.695
Really?

10:55.529 --> 10:58.366
When I asked Granny Micch
why she can heal wounds,

10:58.866 --> 11:00.701
she said, "I just can."

11:01.285 --> 11:03.454
Elves are very good at Life Arts,

11:03.454 --> 11:05.331
so that would make sense.

11:05.748 --> 11:08.542
Life Arts are what I'm best at too.

11:08.542 --> 11:09.710
Really!

11:10.294 --> 11:12.380
Then heal me if I ever get injured.

11:12.380 --> 11:13.714
Of course.

11:13.714 --> 11:16.467
Yay!

11:17.134 --> 11:18.260
<i>But...</i>

11:20.429 --> 11:22.973
<i>my true talent lies in something else...</i>

11:29.980 --> 11:32.108
That's the end of this lesson.

11:32.900 --> 11:34.610
Let's pick up where we finished

11:34.610 --> 11:36.862
- when I come back here.
- Okay!

11:37.488 --> 11:38.781
Can I tell you something?

11:38.781 --> 11:40.533
Of course, what is it?

11:42.868 --> 11:44.120
Hey!

11:44.120 --> 11:45.329
I love you!

11:46.247 --> 11:48.082
Even if you go back to Aureatia.

11:49.166 --> 11:52.962
Yes, and I love you too, Yawika.

11:52.962 --> 11:56.382
You have such big boobs too!

11:56.382 --> 11:59.093
That has nothing to do with anything.

12:02.054 --> 12:03.514
What are you like?

12:04.098 --> 12:06.392
<i>If only for a little while,</i>

12:06.392 --> 12:09.770
<i>I was able to forget
the reason why I came to this village.</i>

12:10.604 --> 12:12.481
<i>I can never tell Yawika</i>

12:12.481 --> 12:13.941
<i>the true reason.</i>

12:15.025 --> 12:18.946
Ishura
This World Has No Common Language

12:26.954 --> 12:29.582
Who knew
that minians took such long baths?

12:31.041 --> 12:32.126
Kia?

12:32.126 --> 12:35.504
And to think you made Yawika
stay in the bath with you the whole time.

12:35.504 --> 12:36.964
Professor Viper.

12:36.964 --> 12:40.801
You mustn't call people such things, Kia.

12:40.801 --> 12:42.094
But it's true.

12:42.094 --> 12:43.971
You're a slob at home,

12:43.971 --> 12:45.723
but outside, you act all sophisticated.

12:47.308 --> 12:48.601
Never mind that.

12:48.601 --> 12:50.728
What are you doing up there?

12:50.728 --> 12:54.148
I was going to take a bath
once you got out.

12:54.148 --> 12:55.733
But you took forever.

12:57.234 --> 12:59.528
Using Word Arts to peep
isn't very nice either.

12:59.528 --> 13:02.656
Who do you think I am? That's obscene.

13:02.656 --> 13:03.866
I can relax up here

13:03.866 --> 13:05.743
because there aren't as many bugs,
that's all.

13:06.327 --> 13:08.913
Were you hoping to take my lesson too?

13:09.330 --> 13:11.791
No! I hate studying.

13:11.791 --> 13:13.501
Yawika is the weird one.

13:16.754 --> 13:18.881
Drop me off next to the professor.

13:28.098 --> 13:29.099
Now go back.

13:35.815 --> 13:36.982
You can have this back.

13:37.817 --> 13:38.901
Thanks.

13:41.946 --> 13:45.324
<i>Words Arts require both
an understanding of the target object</i>

13:45.783 --> 13:47.952
<i>and a special incantation</i>

13:47.952 --> 13:50.496
<i>to weave words
into the soul of the object.</i>

13:50.496 --> 13:51.580
<i>However,</i>

13:51.580 --> 13:53.541
<i>an exception to these rules exists.</i>

13:53.541 --> 13:54.917
<i>Just one exception.</i>

13:54.917 --> 13:59.088
<i>Kia's Word Arts alone,
defy every fundamental rule.</i>

13:59.755 --> 14:01.131
- Kia?
- Hmm?

14:01.757 --> 14:05.094
You mustn't use Word Arts
for every little whim you have.

14:05.094 --> 14:06.387
Your power...

14:06.387 --> 14:10.266
Is a talent
for bringing happiness to others, right?

14:11.600 --> 14:13.435
You're always saying that.

14:13.435 --> 14:16.063
Your power is special.

14:16.730 --> 14:19.400
So it would be boring
if you just used it in a normal way.

14:19.400 --> 14:20.693
Hmph.

14:21.652 --> 14:24.697
As long as I enjoy my life,
then normal is fine by me.

14:25.114 --> 14:27.575
What's normal here
isn't normal outside of Eta.

14:28.158 --> 14:30.953
You'll be enrolling
in a school in Aureatia straight away.

14:31.495 --> 14:34.582
But aren't we about to set off for Lithia,
not Aureatia?

14:34.582 --> 14:36.834
The same goes for Lithia.

14:36.834 --> 14:38.252
Not only are there elves,

14:38.252 --> 14:40.546
there are even dwarves
and leprechauns there.

14:40.546 --> 14:42.506
What! There are races like that there?

14:42.506 --> 14:43.591
Yes.

14:43.591 --> 14:47.094
So you must think about
how other people perceive you.

14:47.678 --> 14:49.763
People might talk badly of you.

14:51.015 --> 14:53.475
I wouldn't care at all!

14:53.475 --> 14:54.810
I could deal with them.

14:54.810 --> 14:56.770
All I'd have to do is say the word "die."

14:57.771 --> 14:59.064
And they'd all die!

15:04.862 --> 15:05.863
Kia!

15:11.827 --> 15:12.912
Ms. Elea!

15:12.912 --> 15:13.996
Ms. Elea.

15:13.996 --> 15:16.081
H-Hello.

15:16.081 --> 15:19.084
Oh. Good morning, Yawika.

15:19.084 --> 15:20.169
You too, Thien.

15:20.169 --> 15:22.546
Since you're both leaving today,

15:22.546 --> 15:25.090
Thien said
he wanted to come and say bye too.

15:25.090 --> 15:28.052
W-Well, I just...

15:28.052 --> 15:29.637
Is that true?

15:29.637 --> 15:32.640
I'm very happy you came too, Thien.

15:32.640 --> 15:33.933
Y-Yes...

15:34.516 --> 15:35.559
M-Ms.

15:35.559 --> 15:38.646
I know Kia acts this way,
but all the kids,

15:38.646 --> 15:40.064
and the adults of the village,

15:40.689 --> 15:42.691
are all... grateful to you.

15:43.192 --> 15:44.318
Me too.

15:44.318 --> 15:46.570
I'm hugely grateful.

15:47.154 --> 15:48.447
Thanks to you,

15:48.447 --> 15:50.574
we're all smarter now.

15:50.574 --> 15:51.742
It's true.

15:52.201 --> 15:53.702
If that's true,

15:53.702 --> 15:56.330
then I'm incredibly happy.

15:56.330 --> 15:59.833
- Oh.
- I'm sure I told you once in class.

15:59.833 --> 16:02.336
Knowledge is like a seed.

16:02.336 --> 16:04.755
So long as you water it with learning,

16:04.755 --> 16:06.340
it will grow all by itself.

16:06.340 --> 16:07.424
Mm.

16:07.424 --> 16:09.343
The person who first planted that seed,

16:09.927 --> 16:11.470
is you, Ms. Elea.

16:11.929 --> 16:14.181
And yet I can't offer anything in return.

16:17.935 --> 16:19.603
Come now.

16:20.187 --> 16:24.274
Finding such cute students as yourselves
is all I could ever ask for.

16:24.274 --> 16:25.985
Isn't that right, Yawika?

16:25.985 --> 16:27.111
Right!

16:27.653 --> 16:29.238
I love you!

16:30.322 --> 16:32.241
Such a barefaced lie.

16:32.741 --> 16:34.618
This is what you call being a bad adult.

16:34.618 --> 16:37.955
K-Kia, you just don't want to go
and study in Aureatia.

16:37.955 --> 16:40.749
Kids who like studying are the weird ones.

16:40.749 --> 16:41.834
Oh, Kia.

16:41.834 --> 16:44.753
Why don't you be honest
with yourself for once?

16:53.595 --> 16:55.222
<i>I assumed a false identity</i>

16:55.222 --> 16:58.017
<i>and secured a study abroad program
in Aureatia for Kia.</i>

16:58.475 --> 17:00.894
<i>That was all for a single purpose.</i>

17:04.815 --> 17:07.234
<i>The Imperial Competition
to determine the Hero.</i>

17:07.818 --> 17:10.237
<i>Kia is capable of beating any opponent.</i>

17:10.863 --> 17:13.615
<i>She could even face off
against Aureatia itself.</i>

17:14.450 --> 17:15.451
<i>If she wins,</i>

17:15.451 --> 17:17.286
<i>then even I, the child of a concubine,</i>

17:17.286 --> 17:19.872
<i>will no longer be looked down upon
by anyone.</i>

17:20.456 --> 17:22.583
Kia! Let's go to our favorite place.

17:22.583 --> 17:24.043
I won't see you for a while.

17:24.043 --> 17:26.336
What? Why do we have to go to that place?

17:26.336 --> 17:28.338
What place might that be?

17:28.338 --> 17:30.674
Is it a favorite place of yours, Kia?

17:30.674 --> 17:33.469
No, it's not, Yawika likes it.

17:33.469 --> 17:35.220
I just went with her, that's all.

17:35.220 --> 17:37.097
Take me there!

17:37.097 --> 17:38.807
Okay, fine.

17:38.807 --> 17:41.810
You don't need to come,
Professor Viper.

17:41.810 --> 17:43.687
It's not that great of a place.

17:44.813 --> 17:46.565
Uh... Wait!

17:46.565 --> 17:47.775
That's fine.

17:47.775 --> 17:50.778
Or maybe I will tag along!

17:51.361 --> 17:53.197
You really don't need to come!

18:03.874 --> 18:06.960
I never knew that hill had
a hidden path in the bushes.

18:06.960 --> 18:08.045
Right!

18:08.587 --> 18:11.965
It leads to a place where you can see
the tip of the village watchtower.

18:13.759 --> 18:17.304
Wild boars or deer might use this path.

18:17.930 --> 18:19.598
Wild boars are no problem.

18:19.598 --> 18:21.558
I can get rid of them with my Force Arts.

18:21.558 --> 18:23.435
You're amazing, Thien!

18:23.435 --> 18:27.064
I could hook the whole pack
on the top of a big tree.

18:27.064 --> 18:28.607
You're amazing too, Kia!

18:28.607 --> 18:32.069
Don't leave your professor behind!

18:34.196 --> 18:36.073
<i>An adult minia can advance in single file</i>

18:36.073 --> 18:37.741
<i>without any real problems.</i>

18:38.408 --> 18:40.828
<i>This direction should bring us out
at the Fourth Mountain.</i>

18:43.038 --> 18:44.623
<i>At the harvest festival,</i>

18:44.957 --> 18:47.376
<i>I recorded
the defensive measures that were taken,</i>

18:48.001 --> 18:51.922
<i>while being mesmerized
by the fervor and beauty of it all.</i>

18:52.589 --> 18:55.634
<i>While teaching the uses of forest plants,</i>

18:56.218 --> 18:59.847
<i>I sent detailed records of certain
medicinal herbs to Aureatia by bird.</i>

19:00.347 --> 19:04.309
<i>I investigated this secluded region
where dense fog hinders human passage.</i>

19:04.893 --> 19:06.520
<i>Eventually, the army of Aureatia</i>

19:06.520 --> 19:09.273
<i>will probably take everything
from this village.</i>

19:10.482 --> 19:13.485
<i>A rumor from the era
of the True Demon King talks of a village,</i>

19:13.485 --> 19:16.655
<i>where a certain individual
has almighty Word Arts.</i>

19:16.655 --> 19:19.158
<i>I found the village's location
from a captured Lithia soldier.</i>

19:19.616 --> 19:22.035
<i>That soldier is no longer in this world.</i>

19:23.287 --> 19:24.288
<i>All that's left,</i>

19:24.288 --> 19:27.166
<i>is to deal with anyone
who knows about my relationship</i>

19:27.166 --> 19:28.584
<i>with the World Word.</i>

19:28.584 --> 19:30.419
Look, we're here.

19:30.419 --> 19:31.920
That was tiring, huh?

19:31.920 --> 19:33.547
Are you tired too, Ms. Elea?

19:33.547 --> 19:35.382
Oh, yes.

19:35.382 --> 19:36.925
Is this really the place?

19:38.927 --> 19:42.139
See? It's nothing special.

19:42.764 --> 19:44.725
This is why I told you not to come.

19:47.311 --> 19:48.937
It's because of the clouds.

19:48.937 --> 19:50.981
Kia, why don't you just clear them away?

19:51.398 --> 19:53.025
Good idea!

19:53.025 --> 19:54.610
I'm glad we have Kia here.

19:56.612 --> 19:58.280
Clear them away?

19:58.280 --> 19:59.573
How would that work?

19:59.573 --> 20:01.116
- Stop already.
- Hmm?

20:01.116 --> 20:03.952
You both make it sound so easy.

20:03.952 --> 20:05.120
Still,

20:05.120 --> 20:08.540
I wouldn't want this to be
my last memory of this village.

20:09.333 --> 20:12.544
It's not like I'm doing this
just to prove I can.

20:13.503 --> 20:14.504
Hmm?

20:15.756 --> 20:16.757
Clear away.

20:52.417 --> 20:53.585
<i>She's invincible.</i>

20:53.919 --> 20:55.921
<i>This power makes her invincible.</i>

20:56.338 --> 20:58.799
<i>No matter who stands in her way,</i>

20:58.799 --> 21:00.342
<i>Kia will win.</i>

21:00.342 --> 21:04.471
See? The view isn't that great.

21:07.808 --> 21:09.142
Ms.?

21:11.144 --> 21:12.896
Is something wrong?

21:13.272 --> 21:14.314
Ms.?

21:14.314 --> 21:15.774
Are you crying?

21:16.650 --> 21:17.901
I'm not crying.

21:18.402 --> 21:19.736
I'm not.

21:20.362 --> 21:21.697
I'm not crying.

21:26.493 --> 21:29.329
<i>She is the one
who ignores all laws of nature,</i>

21:29.329 --> 21:33.375
<i>possessing the power
to warp anything in existence.</i>

21:33.959 --> 21:37.963
<i>The one who surpasses all nature,</i>

21:37.963 --> 21:40.757
<i>dominating the entire world
with a single word.</i>

21:41.341 --> 21:44.970
<i>The one who rejects all analyses</i>

21:44.970 --> 21:48.890
<i>and predictions,
a singularity beyond all else.</i>

21:49.474 --> 21:50.892
<i>At present,</i>

21:50.892 --> 21:53.562
<i>the limits of this almighty savant</i>

21:53.562 --> 21:56.064
<i>are yet to be measured.</i>

22:01.570 --> 22:05.240
<i>She is a Wizard. She is an elf.
She is Kia the World Word.</i>

23:36.832 --> 23:38.834
Translated by Zacarias Hicks

23:38.834 --> 23:39.918
Episode 5

23:39.918 --> 23:41.002
Higuare the Pelagic
and Nastique the Quiet Singer
